# Cloudflare Pages reads this Netlify-style file from the publish dir.
# #2082: HSTS/CSP/X-Frame-Options — previously unset (verified live via `curl -I` against
# app.wifihaven.net, which had only x-content-type-options + referrer-policy per the #369 audit).
# The JWT lives in localStorage (web/src/api/client.ts), so an absent CSP would let a future XSS
# exfiltrate it to any host — default-src 'self' is the load-bearing line here. This CSP is
# duplicated from the API's equivalent (api/src/SecurityHeaders.scala) — same permissive
# style-src/img-src allowance for Vite/React/Tailwind's inline styles and embedded icons.
# img-src also allows https://icons.duckduckgo.com: app templates render their favicons from
# https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/<domain>.ico, so the icon host must be allowlisted (#2115).
# connect-src legitimately differs from the API copy (concrete hosts here vs ws:/wss: there).
# The shared directives that must agree — default-src 'self', font-src (#2468), the img-src icon
# host, frame-ancestors 'none', and the Plain hosts — are pinned by web/src/security-headers.test.ts
# (this copy) and api SecurityHeadersSpec (the Scala copy), so neither can silently drop them.
# #2240: the Plain support chat widget (web/src/components/SupportWidget.tsx) injects
# https://chat.cdn-plain.com/index.js and the SDK loads fonts/images/attachments and connects
# to Plain's UK region. The exact hosts below are Plain's documented chat-widget CSP
# (https://help.plain.com/article/chat) — script-src chat.cdn-plain.com; connect-src
# chat.uk.plain.com + the attachment-upload S3 bucket; style-src fonts.googleapis.com; img-src
# the workspace-logo/attachment S3 buckets + i0.wp.com (Gravatar agent avatars). Plain documents
# NO iframe, so no frame-src is added. UK region matches the API's core-api.uk.plain.com default.
# #2418: img-src also needs https://static-assets.plain.com — undocumented by Plain but the SDK
# serves machine-user/AI-agent avatars from it (actor.avatarUrl =
# https://static-assets.plain.com/email-images/machine-user.png for API_USER machine users;
# .../avatars/ari-avatar.svg is hard-coded in the bundle for AI_AGENT), so without it every AI
# reply shows a broken-image placeholder.
# #2468: font-src was absent entirely, so the Google Fonts woff2 files fell back to
# default-src 'self' and were blocked — style-src allowed the CSS (fonts.googleapis.com) but the
# files come from a different host (fonts.gstatic.com). web/index.html loads Inter from Google
# Fonts, so the SPA rendered in the system fallback font in every environment from #2082 until
# this line. Plain's documented widget CSP omits font-src too, but its SDK pulls the same Google
# Fonts CSS, so this one host covers both.
# #2468: script-src also allows https://static.cloudflareinsights.com — the Cloudflare Web
# Analytics beacon, observed being injected into app-staging and blocked (the console violation in
# #2468 is the evidence the injection happens; Web Analytics being enabled on the Pages project is
# dashboard state, see infra/cloudflare/main.tf "Does NOT manage").
# Host-only, not the documented https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js path form:
# Cloudflare appends a cache-buster segment (the observed URL is .../beacon.min.js/v4513226…), and
# a CSP source path not ending in `/` must match the request path EXACTLY, so the path form would
# not match what is actually requested.
# connect-src gets NO beacon host: per Cloudflare's Web Analytics FAQ the beacon reports to
# `connect-src 'self'` under AUTOMATIC injection (proxied — which is what these Pages custom
# domains are) and only to cloudflareinsights.com under MANUAL embedding. The report is
# same-origin /cdn-cgi/rum and is already covered by the existing 'self'.
# The beacon host is deliberately absent from the API copy entirely: the self-hosted deploy has no
# Cloudflare in front of it, so no beacon is ever injected there.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://chat.cdn-plain.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https://icons.duckduckgo.com https://prod-uk-services-workspac-workspacefilespublicbuck-vs4gjqpqjkh6.s3.amazonaws.com https://prod-uk-services-attachm-attachmentsbucket28b3ccf-uwfssb4vt2us.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com https://static-assets.plain.com https://i0.wp.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.wifihaven.net https://api-staging.wifihaven.net wss://api.wifihaven.net wss://api-staging.wifihaven.net https://chat.uk.plain.com https://prod-uk-services-attachm-attachmentsuploadbucket2-1l2e4906o2asm.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
